// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x000CA916 size=191 name=?xfer@W3DRopeDraw@@MAEXPAVXfer@@@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=B hypothesis:cohesion
void W3DRopeDraw::xfer(Xfer *xfer)
{
	DrawModule::xfer(xfer);
	if (!xfer->IsLightCRC())
	{
		xfer->Version1();
		*xfer == m_curLen;
		*xfer == m_maxLen;
		*xfer == m_width;
		*xfer == m_color;
		*xfer == m_curSpeed;
		*xfer == m_maxSpeed;
		*xfer == m_accel;
		*xfer == m_wobbleLen;
		*xfer == m_wobbleAmp;
		*xfer == m_wobbleRate;
		*xfer == m_curWobblePhase;
		*xfer == m_curZOffset;
		if (xfer->IsLoading())
			tossSegments();
	}
}

